Email Header Analysis for Threats
Objectives
By the end of this lab, students will be able to:

Parse and analyze email headers to identify security threats
Implement SPF, DKIM, and DMARC validation techniques
Detect phishing indicators and email spoofing attempts
Create automated tools for email security analysis
Apply threat scoring methodologies to email communications
Prerequisites
Basic Python programming skills
Understanding of email protocols (SMTP, IMAP)
Familiarity with DNS concepts
Linux command line experience
Basic cybersecurity knowledge
