Troubleshooting Tips
DNS Resolution Errors:

Verify internet connectivity
Check DNS server configuration
Use public DNS (8.8.8.8) if needed: echo "nameserver 8.8.8.8" | sudo tee /etc/resolv.conf
Module Import Errors:

Ensure all scripts are in correct directories
Verify Python path: export PYTHONPATH=$PYTHONPATH:~/email_lab/scripts
Reinstall dependencies: pip3 install --upgrade dnspython email-validator
File Permission Issues:

Make scripts executable: chmod +x scripts/*.py
Check file ownership: ls -la samples/
Fix permissions: chmod 644 samples/*.eml
