This lab provided hands-on experience with email security analysis techniques. You implemented parsers for email headers, validators for SPF/DKIM/DMARC authentication mechanisms, and threat detection algorithms. These skills are essential for identifying phishing attempts, preventing email spoofing, and protecting organizations from email-based attacks.

